2026-10-24 03:39:21.777 EDT [4063] LOG:  statement: CREATE FUNCTION mixer_authz.allowed(o text,p text) RETURNS boolean LANGUAGE plpgsql VOLATILE SECURITY DEFINER SET search_path=pg_catalog SET row_security=on AS $$
